### ❌错误标注（序号）
1. a Chinese ancient folk art → 形容词顺序错误：ancient Chinese
2. the kite were → 主谓不一致，改为 kites were
3. imformations → 不可数名词，无复数，改为 messages
4. become → 时态错误，和 later 呼应改为 became
5. relax toy → 修饰名词用形容词 relaxing
6. on spring → 介词错误，季节前用 in spring
7. a outdoor activities → outdoor 元音开头用 an；activities 改为单数 activity
8. as well as embodies → 结构错误，not only...but also 更适合本句递进


### ✨美化版本
The kite is an ancient Chinese folk craft with a history of more than 2,000 years. Originally, kites were used to deliver messages and later gradually became a relaxing toy. 
Spring is the best time to fly kites. In China, kite-flying is not only an outdoor activity but also embodies people’s longing for a better life.


### 📌标准参考译文
The kite is an ancient Chinese folk craft with a history of over 2,000 years. Kites were originally used to send messages and gradually developed into a form of entertainment. 
Spring is the ideal season for flying kites. In China, kite-flying is not merely an outdoor activity, but also carries people’s yearning for a happy life.
